title: "RECLAIM: Can Agents Reproduce the Claims of Machine Learning Papers?"
abstract: "A benchmark of 100 machine learning papers that measures whether an autonomous agent can reproduce a paper's central empirical claim from the artifacts its authors released, under a metered GPU budget and a pinned evidence audit."
